<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 448 NZ cents per kg clean versus 449 at last week's sales, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean) were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 768 vs 762</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 500 vs 502</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 410 vs 412</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 391 vs 399</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
